// Command server is the range-bff entrypoint.
//
// Mirrors services/dialogue-bff/cmd/server/main.go minus webhook wiring.
// Range v1 has no external network ingress (air-gap, spec §3.2). Loads
// config, sets up OTel tracing, builds the JWT verifier, dials range-svc
// over gRPC (mTLS when MTLS_*_FILE env vars are set), connects to NATS for
// SSE job-progress streaming, and starts an HTTP server with a chi router.
// Shutdown is graceful on SIGINT/SIGTERM.
