		// Kite handler's revocation list below for the same reason commonsStore
		// is: Porch's porch_session login authenticates the SAME participant
		// credential as Kite and Commons (D1), so a Kite credential revocation
		// must purge live Porch sessions too, or a revoked participant lingers
		// on Porch until that session's TTL lapses. The Porch HTTP handler
